  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: fixture set_defaults(func=sub.func) with sub a typed parameter yields dispatches_to edges to both helpers.py:func and helpers.py:outer.func (disambiguation_fallback True, handler_name sub.func). argparse_dispatch.py:225-226 still retries rsplit('.')[-1] unconditionally; later commits (16fb262338, 1a995434ea, 4727c6fb84) did not touch it. MECHANISM: dotted handler resolved by its last component without first resolving the root through the file's import bindings. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-vipir,WI-kazut."  # 6c02
